--[[
=====================================================================================
  D O J U T S U   F R A M E W O R K   —   "EYES OF THE SAGE"
  Sharingan -> Mangekyo -> Eternal Mangekyo -> Rinnegan -> Rinne-Sharingan
  Place in: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts   (LocalScript)
=====================================================================================

  CONTROLS
  --------
  E  : Toggle Sharingan on/off (precognition dodge system)
  1  : Awaken Mangekyo Sharingan   (needs: Sharingan, 3 tomoe, 10 dodges)
  2  : Awaken Eternal Mangekyo     (needs: Mangekyo, 15 abilities used)
  3  : Awaken Rinnegan             (needs: EMS, 30 abilities used)
  4  : Awaken Rinne-Sharingan      (needs: Rinnegan, 60 abilities used)

  T  : Amaterasu   (black flames on your mouse target)        [Mangekyo+]
  G  : Tsukuyomi   (genjutsu-freeze a targeted player)         [Mangekyo+]
  F  : Kamui       (phase through reality / short teleport)    [Mangekyo+]
  R  : Susanoo     (toggle giant chakra avatar)                [Mangekyo+]

  Z  : Deva Path - Shinra Tensei (push everything nearby)      [Rinnegan+]
  X  : Deva Path - Bansho Tenin (pull everything nearby)       [Rinnegan+]
  C  : Preta Path - Absorb (shield that eats projectiles)      [Rinnegan+]
  V  : Animal Path - Summon                                    [Rinnegan+]
  B  : Outer Path - Chibaku Tensei (gravity prison)             [Rinnegan+]
  N  : Naraka Path - Self Heal                                  [Rinnegan+]

  M  : Infinite Tsukuyomi (ultimate genjutsu)                  [Rinne-Sharingan]
  L  : Limbo (spawn shadow clones)                             [Rinne-Sharingan]

  H  : Toggle help panel

  LIMITATIONS
  -----------
  * Pure client-side script. Dodging / Susanoo / your own visuals = fully functional.
  * Pushing/pulling physical parts generally replicates because clients usually own
    nearby unanchored parts' physics.
  * Making Tsukuyomi/Infinite Tsukuyomi appear on ANOTHER player's screen, or dealing
    "official" damage to other real players, needs a server relay (Roblox doesn't
    allow client->client Remotes). A tiny optional server script is provided at the
    very bottom of this answer. Without it, those abilities still work great on
    yourself / NPC dummies for testing and single-player use.
=====================================================================================
]]

